painteffect_tiles_random_depth;Sets how much each tile will be randomly pushed in or out.
painteffect_tiles_bevel_width;Sets the size of the beveled area along the edges of each tile.
painteffect_tiles_bevel_depth;Sets how deep the beveled area is in 3D space.
painteffect_tiles_bevel_roundness;Sets how smooth or round the beveled areas is.
painteffect_tiles_corner_roundness;Sets how beveled or rounded the corners of each tile is.
painteffect_tiles_random_rotation;Sets how much each tile will be randomly rotated in 3D space.
painteffect_tiles_rot_max_x;Sets the maximum amount of rotation variation for each tile in the X axis (tilt up/down).
painteffect_tiles_rot_max_y;Sets the maximum amount of rotation variation for each tile in the Y axis (tilt left/right).
painteffect_tiles_rot_max_z;Sets the maximum amount of rotation variation for each tile in the Z axis (spin left/right).
painteffect_tiles_grout_width;Sets the size of the area between tiles, which controls the size of the tiles as well.
