painteffect_projection_uv_offset_v;Sets how far the material properties are moved on the vertical axis.
painteffect_projection_uv_rotation;Sets the angle of the material properties.
painteffect_projection_clamp_planar;Sets whether the projection area will be restricted or if areas outside of the projection will repeat.
painteffect_projection_position_x;Sets the X axis 3D space position for the projection in relation to the texture project's mesh(es).
painteffect_projection_position_y;Sets the Y axis 3D space position for the projection in relation to the texture project's mesh(es).
painteffect_projection_position_z;Sets the Z axis 3D space position for the projection in relation to the texture project's mesh(es).
