painteffect_projection_rotation_z;Sets the Z axis 3D space rotation for the projection in relation to the texture project's mesh(es).
painteffect_projection_spritesheet;If checked, material texture maps will be treated as a spritesheet with the same frame count as the brush tip.
painteffect_projection_tilestrip_frames;Number of variations (columns) in the tile sheet.
painteffect_projection_tilestrip_features;Number of placeable features (rows minus three) in the tile sheet.
painteffect_projection_tilestrip_loop_ends;Use end tiles at the start/end point of a closed loop.
painteffect_projection_tilestrip_randomize; Randomly place feature tiles in empty spaces.
painteffect_projection_uv_size_u;Sets the size of the projected plane on the horizontal axis as a ratio of the texture project's mesh(es).
painteffect_projection_uv_size_v;Sets the size of the projected plane on the vertical axis as a ratio of the texture project's mesh(es).
painteffect_projection_decal_depth;Sets the maximum distance beneath the surface at which the projection will be drawn. Smoothly fades from falloff value.
painteffect_projection_decal_falloff;Sets the distance beneath the surface at which the projection will start fading.
painteffect_projection_decal_offset;Sets the maximum distance above the surface at which the projection will be drawn. No falloff is applied.
painteffect_projection_decal_culling;Sets the maximum angle away from the surface normal at which the projection will stop being drawn. No falloff is applied.
