spline_overlap;Slower but higher quality vector rendering mode that allows multiple shapes to blend onto the same pixel.
spline_import_svg;Import an SVG vector art file to this vector layer.
spline_text_profile_position;Set the position of the profile relative to the border of each letter:  Outside (default), centered, or inside.
spline_per_shape_materials;Set whether material properties are set individualy for each shape.
spline_per_shape_fonts;Set whether font properties are set individualy for each shape.
