painteffect_seed_value;Sets the initial seed which can be adjusted to create a unique variation of the effect.
;
painttool_backface_culling;Sets the maximum angle the tool will paint on relative to the center point of the brush.
painttool_backface_falloff;Sets how gradually the culling function fades to the maximum value.
painttool_use_normal_map_for_culling;Sets whether the normal map influences the culling function. When on, the surface details in the normal map will be used for culling.
;
painttool_floodfill_tolerance;Sets the maximum amount of value difference the tool will fill in relative to value at the sample point.
painttool_floodfill_solid;Determines whether the fill tool will create a shape with opaque edges or if the edges will fade relative to the value tolerance.
painttool_floodfill_anti_aliased;Determines where the edges will be filtered to soften and reduce jaggedness.
painttool_floodfill_apply_to;Determines which mesh elements the tool will fill.
painttool_select_from;Determines which elements in the texture project the tool will sample from.
smudgetool_over_type;Determines how the smudge tool can work across various boundaries.
;
painttool_gradientpainter_intensity;Sets the strength of the gradient.
painttool_gradientpainter_invert;Inverts the gradient.
painttool_gradientpainter_scale;Sets the tiling for the gradient.
;
painttool_decal_falloff_planes;Displays guide planes when manipulating decal depth or falloff via the GUI.
;
gradientslider_edit_color_handle;Edit the color value for the selected handle.
gradientslider_edit_alpha_handle;Edit the alpha value for the selected handle.
gradientslider_color_position;Edit the horizontal position of the selected color handle.
gradientslider_alpha_position;Edit the horizontal position of the selected alpha handle.
;
colorpicker_togglescreensampler;Toggle fullscreen sampling mode. This allows sampling from any part of the screen, including external applications and secondary monitors.
colorpicker_fromlist;Determines which elements of the selected Texture Project will be sampled; Layers, Groups, or the final composite.
colorpicker_maplist;Selects which texture map type to sample the value from.
