vptoollightcontroller_matchHighlight;Places the Light's specular highlight at the sample point. When disabled, the Light is placed perpendicular to the vertex normal of the sample point.
vptoollightcontroller_repositionLight;Determines whether the light will be moved to maintain a constant distance to the sample point. This setting only applies to Spot/Omni lights.
vptoollightcontroller_useNormalMap;Enabling this uses the normal map for sampling light direction, otherwise vertex normals are used.
